<title>USA: Advanced Micro signs loan for German plant.</title>
<headline>Advanced Micro signs loan for German plant.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Micro Devices Inc said Thursday it had signed a 1.65 billion mark ($967 million) loan agreement with a bank syndicate to fund a new semiconductor fabrication factory and research center in Dresden, Germany.</p>
<p>The syndicate, led by Dresdner Bank AG, consists of 17 German and foreign banks, Advanced Micro said.</p>
